      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one thing i'm worried about is the \"erasure\" part—sometimes data gets tucked away in old backups or secondary logs that people forget about. how should we address the risk of data being left behind or \"hiding\" in these different pockets? we need to make sure it's actually gone.",
